## Regenerating

You can safely re-run **Generate** from Skaffo. Any code between these markers is preserved:

```python
# skaffo:keep:start my-region
your code here — never overwritten
# skaffo:keep:end
```

Files you edited *outside* those markers are flagged as conflicts and never
overwritten without asking.

